OL,3,GNEWSAPlot targeting Manchester's Jewish
OL,4,Acommunity disrupted, say police
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe men were detained on suspicion of
OL,7,Foffences under Section 41 of the
OL,8,FTerrorism Act 2000, according to the
OL,9,FMetropolitan Police, which is leading
OL,10,Fthe investigation.
OL,12,FSources have told the BBC the suspected
OL,13,Fplot was "fairly imminent" and in the
OL,14,Flater stages of planning.
